# Amazon mail via the local DavMail gateway (davmail.service).
# "oauth" is a placeholder: DavMail swaps it for the token it holds in
# ~/.davmail.properties, refreshed by davmail-refresh (see mailsync).
IMAPAccount amazon
Host localhost
Port 1143
User wssmts@amazon.com
Pass oauth
SSLType None
AuthMechs LOGIN
# Warning about cleartext password is expected — this is localhost-only to DavMail

IMAPStore amazon-remote
Account amazon

MaildirStore amazon-local
Subfolders Verbatim
Path ~/.local/share/mail/amazon/
Inbox ~/.local/share/mail/amazon/INBOX

Channel amazon
Far :amazon-remote:
Near :amazon-local:
Patterns INBOX Archive "Code Reviews" "Food Menu" Issues Meetings News "On-call tickets" Quip Sent Trash
Create Near
Expunge Far
SyncState *
Sync All
